  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2e965f9168c2046c28c59aa4b83cc1ec, type: 3}
  m_Name: MechanicalMaze
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: GravityBox.Gameplay::GravityBox.Gameplay.LevelDefinition
  Id: steel-lab-mechanicalmaze
  DisplayIndex: 10
  DisplayName: Opposite ways
  Shape: 9
  TeachingHint: Find a holding recess. The two sliders open in opposite directions.
  Environment: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 82e0ce24addfe4fc89b8bbd0db998aea, type: 2}
  Prefab: {fileID: 4497772698900041176, guid: 69f4b8ad743cd4feb9eb41f438a04b92, type: 3}
  RotationMode: 1
  InitialLocalVelocity: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  ParSeconds: 0
  Tutorial: 0
  DesignerSolution: Cross the zigzag west maze into the first holding recess. Tilt
    north to retract slider A, then cross to the central maze. Reach the second holding
    recess and tilt south to retract slider B. Cross into the east maze, navigate
    its alternating turns and roll completely through the circular exit. Both sliders
    remain dynamic and can reclose under reversed gravity. Shared exit assist pulls
    the ball through an unobstructed opening within 40 mm. This is deliberate gameplay
    assistance; the entire sphere must still physically clear the bore before completion.
